f work and jobs in common written and spoken situations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Make and Respond to Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you make and respond to requests, remember to be polite.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Practice the requests and responses below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Making a Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Responding to a Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you mind \u2026<br /> Would you tell me ...<br /> Could you tell me ... <br /> I'd like to get ... <br /> Is there any chance you could \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure.<br />  No problem.<br /> Certainly.<br />  I'd be glad to help  .<br />  I'll see what I can do.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>:Would you mind pointing out where Giza is?<br />  <span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: I'd be glad to help.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>: Could you tell me how much a taxi costs? <br /><span class =\"strong\"> Concierge</span>: No problem. <br/> <br/> <br/>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Using the Infinitive of Purpose", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the<span class=\"italic\"> to</span> + verb (the infinitive)  to express purpose. This answers the question \"Why ... ?\u201d", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Action</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Purpose </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I go to the gym<br /> He locked the door\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to exercise.<br /> to keep everyone out.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>: I want to get a taxi to go to the museum.<br /> <span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: You should bargain to get a good price.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Giza", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the third largest city in Egypt", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to visit the pyramids in Giza.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about Egypt.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "downtown", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the central part of a city", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I went shopping downtown.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fare", "type": "name"}, {"content": "money paid to travel on a bus, cab or other vehicle", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I gave the bus driver my fare to get on the bus.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Egyptian pounds", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the official currency of Egypt", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I exchanged some money for Egyptian pounds.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I'd be glad to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I would be pleased and happy to do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll be glad to travel to Egypt this summer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le11ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a short dialogue between you and a tourist.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell them where they can get a taxi. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain how to get a taxi driver's attention.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell them what the fares are like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue with me and a tourist.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain about taxis and fares.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le11ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le11ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'd like to get some information. Do you have a brochure to explain how to get to the pyramids?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: I'd be glad to help you. Use this map to show you where you are."}, {"image": "engenn5le11ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "12000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I see. Would you mind pointing out where Giza is?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: Certainly. The hotel is here, downtown. The pyramids are her